-- statement:
--   With positive real horizon T, original admissible BV dividend process and the strict terminal cash plus survival terminal value, the true terminal reward is nonnegative almost everywhere and almost-everywhere strongly measurable. Use nonnegative cash, nonnegative pre-ruin reward, proved strict cash cutoff pointwise convergence and integrability of each F mesh.
